message: |
  If you use the DUIS Dataset, please cite the associated paper:

  F. F. Hardiansyah, D. O. Siahaan, and M. Aritsugi,
  “Evaluating Deep Learning Models for Declarative UI Code Smell Detection,”
  in 2026 International Conference on Smart Computing, IoT, and Machine Learning (SIML), 2026.

title: "DUIS Dataset"
